  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:09.130" end="00:12.470" ttm:agent="v1">Uh, yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:12.470" end="00:15.070" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="00:15.070" end="00:17.550" ttm:agent="v1">I'll put your number in my phone</p>
      <p begin="00:17.550" end="00:20.320" ttm:agent="v1">And I might say, &quot;What's up, baby?</p>
      <p begin="00:20.320" end="00:22.720" ttm:agent="v1">I wanna see you tonight&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:22.720" end="00:25.180" ttm:agent="v1">If I got nothin' later on</p>
      <p begin="00:25.180" end="00:27.800" ttm:agent="v1">Then you might be in luck, baby</p>
      <p begin="00:27.800" end="00:30.300" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I wanna see you tonight (oh-oh)</p>
      <p begin="00:30.300" end="00:32.440" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I like you like that, but not like that (no)</p>
      <p begin="00:32.440" end="00:34.370" ttm:agent="v1">Callin' me &quot;bae&quot;, but not quite yet</p>
      <p begin="00:34.370" end="00:35.960" ttm:agent="v1">Don't get pressed if I don't call back</p>
      <p begin="00:35.960" end="00:37.990" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Like yeah (yeah), yeah (yeah)</p>
      <p begin="00:37.990" end="00:39.830" ttm:agent="v1">Pulled up in a Silverado</p>
      <p begin="00:39.830" end="00:42.090" ttm:agent="v1">Said, &quot;What's poppin'?&quot; like he Harlow</p>
      <p begin="00:42.090" end="00:43.790" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Got him making plans for tomorrow (tomorrow)</p>
      <p begin="00:43.790" end="00:45.760" ttm:agent="v1">On a high like he soprano</p>
      <p begin="00:45.760" end="00:49.230" ttm:agent="v1">Cool it, drop it, stop it, I don't know you like that</p>
      <p begin="00:49.230" end="00:52.830" ttm:agent="v1">If you walk it like you talk it, then I'll throw it right back</p>
      <p begin="00:52.830" end="00:56.550" ttm:agent="v1">But if you get outta pocket, then I'll park it where it's at</p>
      <p begin="00:56.550" end="01:00.770" ttm:agent="v1">Uh, you and me is TBD, maybe later we gon' see</p>
      <p begin="01:00.770" end="01:03.260" ttm:agent="v1">I'll put your number in my phone</p>
      <p begin="01:03.260" end="01:06.200" ttm:agent="v1">And I might say, &quot;What's up, baby?</p>
      <p begin="01:06.200" end="01:08.280" ttm:agent="v1">I wanna see you tonight&quot;</p>
      <p begin="01:08.280" end="01:10.640" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">If I got nothin' later on (ooh)</p>
      <p begin="01:10.640" end="01:13.560" ttm:agent="v1">Then you might be in luck, baby</p>
      <p begin="01:13.560" end="01:16.110" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I wanna see you tonight (oh-oh)</p>
      <p begin="01:16.110" end="01:17.870" ttm:agent="v1">Talk real nice, look real fly</p>
      <p begin="01:17.870" end="01:19.980" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I'ma be real, you're just my type (yeah)</p>
      <p begin="01:19.980" end="01:21.710" ttm:agent="v1">But that don't mean I'ma make you mine</p>
      <p begin="01:21.710" end="01:23.670" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Like yeah (yeah), yeah (yeah)</p>
      <p begin="01:23.670" end="01:26.900" ttm:agent="v1">Low lights set the mood, I'm almost tempted</p>
      <p begin="01:26.900" end="01:31.260" ttm:agent="v1">With my hands all over you, I could do damage, but</p>
      <p begin="01:31.260" end="01:34.940" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I'm lookin' out for you, so just keep dancin' (oh)</p>
      <p begin="01:34.940" end="01:36.760" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Kinda like just where your hands is (oh)</p>
      <p begin="01:36.760" end="01:38.870" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">And I might just take some chances (boy, oh)</p>
      <p begin="01:38.870" end="01:41.170" ttm:agent="v1">I'll put your number in my phone</p>
      <p begin="01:41.170" end="01:44.340" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">And I might say, &quot;What's up, baby? (What's up, baby?)</p>
      <p begin="01:44.340" end="01:46.580" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I wanna see you tonight&quot; (oh)</p>
      <p begin="01:46.580" end="01:48.970" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">If I got nothin' later on (later on)</p>
      <p begin="01:48.970" end="01:51.790" ttm:agent="v1">Then you might be in luck, baby</p>
      <p begin="01:51.790" end="01:53.940" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I wanna see you tonight (see you tonight)</p>
      <p begin="01:53.940" end="01:56.440" ttm:agent="v1">I'll put your number in my phone</p>
      <p begin="01:56.440" end="01:59.380" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">And I might say, &quot;What's up, baby?&quot; (Ooh)</p>
      <p begin="01:59.380" end="02:01.670" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I wanna see you tonight&quot; (wanna see)</p>
      <p begin="02:01.670" end="02:04.420" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">If I got nothin' later on (I got nothin', nothin')</p>
      <p begin="02:04.420" end="02:07.180" ttm:agent="v1">Then you might be in luck, baby</p>
      <p begin="02:07.180" end="02:09.100" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I wanna see you tonight (oh)</p>
      <p begin="02:09.100" end="02:13.100" ttm:agent="v1"/>
